# Forsaken Monument (CR 613.4c, layer 7c; CR 603.2): colorless creatures its controller controls get +2/+2 - the Ornithopter
# is 2/4 while the green Grizzly Bears stay 2/2 and Bot2's Ornithopter stays 0/2. Its last ability gains 2 life when Bot1
# casts the colorless Ornithopter and nothing for the colored Bears; the Monument itself was cast before it was on the
# battlefield, so its own cast gains nothing.

